#UI BMS 4.38 update, April 2023, by Kolbe

#This is the Main Menu in the TE Play Window.

#It contains:
#- Missions
#- Victory Conditions
#- Save
#- Logbook
#- ACMI
#- Tact. Reference
#- Comms
#- Setup
#- Exit


